      "review_note": "Maqayis gives only the broad known qiththa item. Ayn and Sihah group the produce, singular, place, and abundance derivatives under the same entry. Tahdhib is used only for its qiththa/cucumber phrases; its gathering and drawing-together material is excluded in review.",
